+
+Runner alone may use its already configured headless browser/Playwright runtime in a fresh bound A0 diagnostic slot. Start the exact scripts/serve-r14.mjs [48741] command, open /?diagnostic=1 without visibility/focus/input takeover, await window.ATM or preserve the real startup error, and apply the listed calls serially. Keep actual readiness/console/network/shader failures; never create mock DOM/device/world globals. Request screenshot bytes through the tool-native or configured runtime capture only.
+
+The11 groups have at most20 screenshots total,10 mounts and180s total deadline. Takram shader/LUT failure, missing float extension, port conflict, context restore timeout or missing actual fields ends only its dependent proof. Preserve raw partial results; no automatic fallback-retry, foreign cleanup or fabricated timer0. Whole13 bundles and LaneB admission remain BLOCKED.
+
+Case negatives use defect1/2/3 from the actual volume shader and the unchanged0.002 image threshold. Record negative ineffectiveness as FAIL; CPU48x32 synthetic arithmetic images are separate inherited artifacts and are not rendered screenshots or pixel goldens for this scene.
+
+The server's traversal/method/regular-file/content-type/loopback checks are retained exactly. Only the literal dist root changes; no server/self-check/browser was executed for R14. Stale-atlas and unsupported actual atmosphere cases are explicitly Source-CPU or missing-actual-input in the request, rather than invented resource mutations.
+
+Reference acceptance is deferred to the user's other PC. No product integration/adoption follows from diagnostic images or Source/CPU results.
